# Haul Away Joe: traditional sea shanty, text after Whall (1910).
{title: Haul Away Joe}
{composer: Traditional (sea shanty)}
{key: Em}
{tempo: 100}
{time: 4/4}
{x_level: 1}
{x_strum: D - D - D - D -}

{comment: Quarter-note downs to start; later try D - D U - U D U.}

{start_of_grid label="Verse"}
| Em . . . |
| D . . . |
